    (HERE/'README.md').write_text('# Scaling and sibling follow-up\n\n- [Detailed report and figures](REPORT.md)\n- [Machine-readable summary](summary.json)\n- [Frozen protocol](protocol.json)\n- Original block-fidelity experiment remains unchanged.\n- Internal teaching PPTX is under internal/ and excluded from Git.\n- Deliverable 6 additions are deferred; nothing pushed.\n')
    (HERE/'deliverable_6_review_pending.md').write_text('# Pending 4:10 p.m. Deliverable 6 review\n\nDo not insert automatically.\n\n- Add the separate scaling and sibling-ablation questions, conditions, paired CIs and honest conclusions.\n- Include the direct biological-minus-Potts figure and fragile-class effects.\n- Keep the four-patch upstream-overlap qualification and identify this as reused exploratory data.\n- BCSS includes a convergence-time control; PanNuke has local-optimum audits but no matched convergence/time ablation.\n- BCSS includes error-location/oracle ceilings and class-presence analysis; PanNuke has boundary/interior diagnostics but not those same analyses. Do not invent them.\n- BCSS checks candidate biological rules against fitting GT; PanNuke has adjacency statistics and an inherited prior, not equivalent validation of regional rules.\n- Preserve BCSS sections. No new document claims until actual results are reviewed.\n')
